---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "@/components/PageHeader.astro";
import { format } from "date-fns";

const lastUpdated = new Date("2026-06-14");
---

<Layout
  title="Now"
  description="What I'm doing now — a snapshot of my current focus and activities."
  url="https://ekel.dev/now"
  ogImage="now.png"
>
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-start">
    <PageHeader title="Now" eyebrow="Current focus">
      Last updated {format(lastUpdated, "MMMM d, yyyy")}.
    </PageHeader>

    <div class="mt-10 w-full border-b border-border/70 slide-enter-content sm:mt-16">
      <section class="grid gap-4 border-t border-border/70 py-8 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h2 class="m-0 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
          Work
        </h2>
        <p class="m-0 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-foreground text-pretty">
          I'm working as a Web Programmer (Basically Fullstack Web Developer
          that also do DevOps stuff). Main stack: Typescript, Go, Docker.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid gap-4 border-t border-border/70 py-8 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h2 class="m-0 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
          Learning
        </h2>
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <p class="m-0 leading-7 text-foreground text-pretty">
            Deep dive into Go, DevOps, also how to deal and manage people.
            Occasionally reading about personal finance and (only) investing on
            sharia stock. For stock market, I'm interested in fundamental
            analysis, corporate action, big money movement, and market sentiment.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-px border border-border/70 bg-border/70 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <blockquote class="m-0 bg-background p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-foreground">
              <p class="m-0">“Be fearful when others are greedy, and greedy when others are fearful.”</p>
              <footer class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">— Warren Buffett</footer>
            </blockquote>
            <blockquote class="m-0 bg-background p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-foreground">
              <p class="m-0">“Risk is what you pay for opportunity.”</p>
              <footer class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">— Andry Hakim</footer>
            </blockquote>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="grid gap-4 border-t border-border/70 py-8 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h2 class="m-0 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
          Reading
        </h2>
        <p class="m-0 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-foreground text-pretty">
          Currently reading <strong class="font-medium">Ini Koding</strong> by Hilman Ramadhan and
          <strong class="font-medium">Make Time</strong> by Jake Knapp & John Zeratsky.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid gap-4 border-t border-border/70 py-8 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        <h2 class="m-0 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
          Playlist
        </h2>
        <p class="m-0 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-foreground text-pretty">
          I don't have any music playlist because my music taste is random. Also
          I rarely listen to music. But I have a <a
            href="https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLcauesmgnpZ9BBTEFyotPzX9MotTEVdKx&si=DCSEaL1jMkeidZ79"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Murottal Playlist (opens in new tab)"
            >Murottal Playlist</a
          > that updated regularly and always listen to it when I'm working or do
          something that require focus.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid gap-4 border-t border-border/70 py-8 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_9rem_1fr] sm:gap-6">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        <h2 class="m-0 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground">
          Stuff
        </h2>
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <p class="m-0 leading-7 text-foreground text-pretty">
            Well, outside of my interest in tech and finance, I also love to take
            care of my <a
              href="https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yamaha_Jupiter_MX"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="Yamaha Jupiter MX (opens in new tab)"
              >2014 motorcycle</a
            > and do some modifications to it. Here are some modifications that I've done:
          </p>
          <ul class="mb-0 mt-6 grid list-none gap-x-8 gap-y-3 p-0 text-sm leading-6 text-foreground sm:grid-cols-2" role="list">
            <li class="border-s border-border/70 ps-4">Daytona oil filter, air filter, and spark plug header.</li>
            <li class="border-s border-border/70 ps-4">NGK Iridium spark plug.</li>
            <li class="border-s border-border/70 ps-4">BRT Chemco wheels.</li>
            <li class="border-s border-border/70 ps-4">Yamaha 125Z side-view mirrors.</li>
            <li class="border-s border-border/70 ps-4">80/80-17 front and 90/80-17 rear tires.</li>
            <li class="border-s border-border/70 ps-4">Latex foam seat with a custom cover.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
